{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_01.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tinkerlands, players find themselves stranded on an island. They must craft, scavenge equipment, build a town for fellow survivors, and face various dangers in this mysterious world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_02.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/1.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The islands are full of things to explore. Enhance your character's strength by discovering loot and crafting weapons and gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_03.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/building_co-op.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish a community where diverse characters can join and assist you throughout your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_04.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources from the island's environment and vanquish monsters to craft formidable weapons\u2014or less powerful ones, if that's your preference. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_05.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/4.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These islands harbor magic, peculiar creatures, and even things that defy the laws of physics. Let your imagination run wild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_06.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/slimeking_co-op.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic adventure with your comrades, braving the mysteries of Tinkerlands together. Unite, thrive, and conquer the challenges as one!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2617700?t=1743685445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743685445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/2bff0c61ced55b8689161a04f7e88634bfecefc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743685445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/2bff0c61ced55b8689161a04f7e88634bfecefc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743685445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3185760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_01.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tinkerlands, players find themselves stranded on an island. They must craft, scavenge equipment, build a town for fellow survivors, and face various dangers in this mysterious world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_02.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/1.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The islands are full of things to explore. Enhance your character's strength by discovering loot and crafting weapons and gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_03.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/building_co-op.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish a community where diverse characters can join and assist you throughout your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_04.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources from the island's environment and vanquish monsters to craft formidable weapons\u2014or less powerful ones, if that's your preference. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_05.png?t=1743685445\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/4.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These islands harbor magic, peculiar creatures, and even things that defy the laws of physics. Let your imagination run wild! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/english_06.png?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/slimeking_co-op.gif?t=1743685445\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic adventure with your comrades, braving the mysteries of Tinkerlands together. Unite, thrive, and conquer the challenges as one!</p>","developers":["CodeManu","Endless Coffee"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/header.jpg?t=1743685445","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121773,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121773/movie480.mp4?t=1743685442","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121773/movie_max.mp4?t=1743685442"},"name":"Tinkerlands - New co-op gameplay trailer with Early Access features","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121773/7f4f88de3a44c0d1fea0d85c4b4f01bcf8efc015/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743685442","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121773/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743685442","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121773/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743685442"}}],"name":"Tinkerlands","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Win 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Int